---
layout: base.njk
title: Projects
description: Fixed-scope technology projects. Data, AI, cloud, product engineering, quality engineering, Salesforce, SAP, RPA, and business transformation. Nine practice areas with a set delivery date.
permalink: /services/
---

{% set accent = "var(--color-pixel-cyan)" %}

<section class="section pt-20 md:pt-28 pb-16 md:pb-24">
  <div class="wrapper grid-edit">
    <div class="col-span-12">
      <h1 class="font-display font-medium text-hero leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.035em] text-balance reveal-mask">
        <span>Projects with a</span>
        <span class="block italic" style="color: {{ accent }}">set delivery date.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-8 md:mt-10 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl text-ink-secondary reveal reveal-delay-2 pretty">
        Nine practice areas. Fixed scope. Written plan. A delivery date we hold ourselves to.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section border-t border-ink-primary">
  <div class="wrapper">
    {% set services = [
      { slug: "data-analytics",          num: "01", title: "Data & Analytics",     blurb: "Modern data platforms from ingestion to decision. Warehouse and lakehouse builds, semantic layers, self-serve analytics, executive reporting." },
      { slug: "ai-automation",           num: "02", title: "AI & Automation",      blurb: "LLM pipelines, document intelligence, forecasting, anomaly detection. Applied AI that runs in production." },
      { slug: "cloud-modernization",     num: "03", title: "Cloud Modernization",  blurb: "Migrations, rearchitectures, landing zones, FinOps. We pick AWS, Azure, or GCP based on where your workloads live." },
      { slug: "product-engineering",     num: "04", title: "Product Engineering",  blurb: "Custom software builds. Web, mobile, APIs, and internal platforms. Designed, built, tested, shipped with a calendar." },
      { slug: "quality-engineering",     num: "05", title: "Quality Engineering",  blurb: "Test automation, performance engineering, release discipline. Quality programs that cut cycle time." },
      { slug: "salesforce",              num: "06", title: "Salesforce",           blurb: "Sales Cloud, Service Cloud, Data Cloud, and the integration layer to your ERP. Implementations, optimizations, and rescues." },
      { slug: "sap-s4hana",              num: "07", title: "SAP / S4HANA",         blurb: "S/4HANA implementations, greenfield and brownfield. Data migration, integration with non-SAP systems, and reporting layers finance will use." },
      { slug: "rpa",                     num: "08", title: "RPA",                  blurb: "Robotic process automation where it earns its keep. UiPath, Power Automate, Automation Anywhere. Scoped for ROI." },
      { slug: "business-transformation", num: "09", title: "Business Transformation", blurb: "Operating model redesign, process re-engineering, and the change program needed to land the tech." }
    ] %}

    <ul>
      {% for svc in services %}
        <li class="reveal reveal-delay-{{ (loop.index0 % 4) + 1 }}">
          <a href="/services/{{ svc.slug }}/" class="group flex items-start gap-5 md:gap-8 py-8 md:py-10 border-t border-ink-primary {% if loop.last %}border-b{% endif %} transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-bg-subtle">
            <span class="meta pt-2 text-ink-secondary shrink-0">{{ svc.num }}</span>
            <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:gap-14">
              <h3 class="font-display font-medium text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-[2.25rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] lg:w-[44%] lg:shrink-0 min-w-0 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="shrink-0" style="display:inline-block;width:.625rem;height:.625rem;background: {{ accent }}"></span>
                {{ svc.title }}
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-3 lg:mt-0 lg:flex-1 min-w-0 text-ink-secondary pretty">{{ svc.blurb }}</p>
            </div>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="mt-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h12m0 0L9 3m5 5l-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"/></svg>
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-statement">
  <div class="wrapper grid-edit">
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-5">
      <span class="meta section-number reveal" style="--accent: var(--color-pixel-orange); color: var(--color-ink-inverse-secondary)">How projects run</span>
      <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.025em] mt-6 balance reveal">
        Eight to fourteen weeks. Scope locked before we start.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-ink-inverse-secondary max-w-md pretty reveal reveal-delay-1">
        Every project runs the same way. We scope it. We plan it. We ship it. We hand it off. Exit criteria in writing before kickoff.
      </p>
      <a href="/approach/" class="btn bg-transparent text-ink-inverse border-ink-inverse-secondary mt-8 hover:bg-ink-inverse hover:text-ink-primary hover:border-ink-inverse reveal reveal-delay-2">
        How we engage
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7h10m0 0L8 3m4 4l-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-7 md:pl-8">
      <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div>
          <dt class="meta text-ink-inverse-secondary">Typical length</dt>
          <dd class="font-display font-medium text-3xl md:text-4xl mt-2">8 to 14 weeks</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="meta text-ink-inverse-secondary">Team shape</dt>
          <dd class="font-display font-medium text-3xl md:text-4xl mt-2">3 to 8 people</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="meta text-ink-inverse-secondary">Scope</dt>
          <dd class="font-display font-medium text-3xl md:text-4xl mt-2">Fixed, written</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="meta text-ink-inverse-secondary">Pricing</dt>
          <dd class="font-display font-medium text-3xl md:text-4xl mt-2">Not by the hour</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
